{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  GS CARD PRODUCT
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 snippets/product-card-grid.liquid (18.4 KB)
  ==================================================================
  NAMED gs-card-product, NOT card-product. Dawn ships its own
  snippets/card-product.liquid that its native sections depend on.

  USAGE: render 'gs-card-product', cardProduct: product

  OPTIONAL PARAMS:
    gridImageSize   'landscape' | 'square' | 'portrait' | nil (natural)
    cycleIndex      integer, drives eager/fetchpriority for the first 4
    hideContent     true to render image only
    complementary   true when used in a cross-sell context
    quickViewtrue   true to allow the quick-view affordance
    compareTrue     true to allow the compare checkbox
    showCount       true to allow the countdown timer
    showSwatches    true to render colourway swatches
    enableQuickAdd  true for the size-picker overlay

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  REVISION 2026-08-14 - EVEN CARDS, AND A REAL QUICK VIEW
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. ONE RESERVED CONTENT REGION, BUTTON PINNED BELOW IT.
     gs-reviews and the swatch snippet render nothing when a product has
     no reviews / no colourways, so cards were different heights and the
     buttons below sat out of line. Title, rating, price and swatches now
     sit in .product-card-content, which has a reserved min-height
     (--gs-card-content-height in gs-card-product.css); the button is
     pinned to the card's bottom edge with `margin-top: auto`.

  2. THE QUICK VIEW BUTTON DOES SOMETHING NOW.
     It said QUICK VIEW and was a plain link to the product page - the
     modal was never ported from v3. It still IS a real link, so it works
     with JavaScript off and is crawlable, but it now carries the product
     handle and gs-quick-view.js intercepts the click to open a dialog.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  EARLIER: MOST OF THE CARD WAS SWITCHED OFF
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Nine features were gated on gs-shopify-v3 THEME SETTINGS with no entry
  in Dawn's settings_schema.json - quickview, compare,
  enable_color_swatches, show_countdown, product_second_image and more.
  Every one evaluated to nil, so hover images, swatches, quick view,
  compare and the countdown were silently off, and prices and badges did
  not render anywhere on the site.

  THE RULE: a missing setting means ENABLED. Each is tested with an
  explicit `== false` so an absent schema entry fails open.

  Two deliberate exceptions, both opt-IN:
    - show_inventory: needs low_inventory thresholds to be meaningful
    - enableQuickAdd: a caller decision, not a theme setting

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  CRITICAL FIX FROM v3: FULL PRODUCT JSON ON EVERY CARD
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 emitted data-product-details-json with the complete product object
  on every card. REMOVED. ACTION: grep theme.js for
  `product-details-json` before relying on this.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER v3 FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Two inline <style> blocks per card moved to gs-card-product.css.
  - `cardProduct.tite` typo gave every card an aria-label with no name.
  - Compare ids were seeded from nanoseconds, risking duplicate DOM ids
    and defeating full-page caching.
  - The second-image branch passed a media object, not .preview_image.
  - Hardcoded $19.99 fallback price.
  - Size abbreviation turned 'X-Large' into 'X-L'.
  - A filter cannot appear inside an if condition.
  - AOS and lazysizes removed.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-card-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign card_variant = cardProduct.selected_or_first_available_variant

  # Missing setting means enabled. See the header note.
  assign show_second_image = true
  if settings.product_second_image == false
    assign show_second_image = false
  endif

  assign show_quickview = true
  if settings.quickview == false
    assign show_quickview = false
  endif

  assign show_compare = true
  if settings.compare == false
    assign show_compare = false
  endif

  assign show_swatch_row = true
  if settings.enable_color_swatches == false
    assign show_swatch_row = false
  endif

  assign show_countdown = true
  if settings.show_countdown == false
    assign show_countdown = false
  endif

  assign show_vendor = false
  if settings.product_vendor == true
    assign show_vendor = true
  endif

  assign show_inventory = false
  if settings.show_inventory == true
    assign show_inventory = true
  endif

  assign quickview_style = settings.quickview_style | default: 'button'

  case gridImageSize
    when 'landscape'
      assign image_ratio = 'var(--img-landscape)'
    when 'square'
      assign image_ratio = 'var(--img-square)'
    when 'portrait'
      assign image_ratio = 'var(--img-portrait)'
    else
      if cardProduct.featured_media.preview_image.aspect_ratio
        assign image_ratio = 1 | divided_by: cardProduct.featured_media.preview_image.aspect_ratio | times: 100 | append: '%'
      else
        assign image_ratio = '100%'
      endif
  endcase

  assign product_url = cardProduct.url | within: collection
  if settings.hide_collection_from_url == true
    assign product_url = cardProduct.url
  endif

  if show_inventory and complementary != true
    assign total_stock = 0
    assign stock_known = true

    for variant in cardProduct.variants
      if variant.inventory_management == blank or variant.inventory_policy == 'continue'
        assign stock_known = false
        break
      endif
      if variant.inventory_quantity > 0
        assign total_stock = total_stock | plus: variant.inventory_quantity
      endif
    endfor

    if cardProduct.available == false
      assign stock_content = settings.card_out_of_stock_text | default: 'Out of stock'
      assign stock_color = settings.product_no_stock_color | default: '#777777'
    elsif stock_known == false
      assign stock_content = settings.card_in_stock_text | default: 'Available now'
      assign stock_color = settings.product_in_stock_color | default: '#002F6E'
    elsif total_stock > 0 and total_stock <= settings.low_inventory
      assign stock_content = settings.card_low_stock_text | default: 'Low stock'
      assign stock_color = settings.product_low_stock_color | default: '#AB192D'
    else
      assign stock_content = settings.card_in_stock_text | default: 'Available now'
      assign stock_color = settings.product_in_stock_color | default: '#002F6E'
    endif
  endif

  assign show_meta_row = false
  if cardProduct != blank and complementary != true
    if show_inventory or show_vendor
      assign show_meta_row = true
    endif
  endif

  assign tag_hit = false
  if settings.enable_collection_product_badge and settings.collection_product_badge_tag_match != blank
    assign tag_match = settings.collection_product_badge_tag_match | downcase
    for product_tag in cardProduct.tags
      assign product_tag_down = product_tag | downcase
      if product_tag_down == tag_match
        assign tag_hit = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}

<div class="product-card-item" data-product-grid>
  <div class="product-card">

    <div class="product-card-img{% if cardProduct.media.size > 1 %} on-hover-img{% endif %}">
      <a
        class="product-img"
        {% if cardProduct == blank %}role="link" aria-disabled="true"{% else %}href="{{ product_url }}"{% endif %}
        tabindex="-1"
        title="{{ cardProduct.title | escape | default: shop.name }}"
      >
        <div class="media" style="--imageRatio: {{ image_ratio }};">
          {%- if cardProduct.featured_media.preview_image -%}
            {%- assign fm = cardProduct.featured_media.preview_image -%}
            <img
              class="product-image"
              src="{{ fm | image_url: width: 500 }}"
              srcset="
                {{ fm | image_url: width: 300 }} 300w,
                {{ fm | image_url: width: 500 }} 500w,
                {{ fm | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
                {{ fm | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 990px) 25vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 50vw"
              alt="{{ fm.alt | escape | default: cardProduct.title | escape }}"
              width="{{ fm.width }}"
              height="{{ fm.height }}"
              loading="{% if cycleIndex and cycleIndex <= 4 %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}"
              {% if cycleIndex and cycleIndex <= 4 %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}
              style="object-position: {{ fm.presentation.focal_point | default: 'center' }};"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            {{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if show_second_image and cardProduct.media[1].preview_image -%}
          {%- assign sm = cardProduct.media[1].preview_image -%}
          <div class="product-second-img">
            <img
              class="product-img-hover"
              src="{{ sm | image_url: width: 500 }}"
              srcset="{{ sm | image_url: width: 500 }} 500w, {{ sm | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w"
              sizes="(min-width: 990px) 25vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 50vw"
              alt=""
              width="{{ sm.width }}"
              height="{{ sm.height }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if cardProduct.available and show_countdown and showCount and complementary != true -%}
          {%- render 'gs-product-countdown', cardProduct: cardProduct -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>

      {%- if cardProduct != blank and complementary != true -%}
        <div class="product-card-badges">
          {%- render 'gs-product-badge', cardProduct: cardProduct -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if tag_hit -%}
        <span class="product-holiday-badge" style="background-color: {{ settings.collection_product_badge_bg_color }};">
          {{ settings.collection_product_badge_text }}
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if show_quickview and quickview_style == 'icon' and cardProduct != blank and quickViewtrue -%}
        <a
          class="quick-view-icon product-quickview"
          href="{{ product_url }}"
          aria-label="{{ 'onboarding.quickview' | t }}: {{ cardProduct.title | escape }}"
          data-quick-view="{{ cardProduct.handle }}"
        >
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M20.7097 19.3324L17.7419 16.3739L17.8817 16.191C19.172 14.5234 19.8495 12.5331 19.8495 10.4352C19.8495 5.22808 15.6237 1 10.4301 1C5.23656 1 1 5.22808 1 10.4352C1 15.6423 5.22581 19.8704 10.4301 19.8704C12.5269 19.8704 14.5054 19.1926 16.172 17.9123L16.3548 17.7725L16.4194 17.837L19.3118 20.731C19.6882 21.1076 20.3441 21.1076 20.7097 20.731C20.8925 20.5481 21 20.3007 21 20.0317C21 19.7628 20.8925 19.5261 20.7097 19.3324ZM10.4194 17.9016C6.30108 17.9016 2.95699 14.5557 2.95699 10.4352C2.95699 6.31469 6.31183 2.9688 10.4301 2.9688C14.5484 2.9688 17.8925 6.31469 17.8925 10.4352C17.8925 14.5557 14.5484 17.9016 10.4301 17.9016H10.4194Z" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if enableQuickAdd and cardProduct.variants.size > 1 -%}
        <div class="quick-add-variants">
          <p>{{ 'products.product.pick_a_size' | t }}</p>
          <div class="qa-size-options">
            {%- for variant in cardProduct.variants -%}
              <div class="qa-size" data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}" data-variant-available="{{ variant.available }}">
                {{- variant.title -}}
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="product-card-detail">
      {%- comment -%}
        Reserved region between the image and the button. Its min-height
        (--gs-card-content-height in gs-card-product.css) is what keeps
        card heights equal; the button is pinned below it.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="product-card-content">
      {%- if show_meta_row -%}
        <div class="product-card-info">
          {%- if show_vendor -%}
            <span class="vendor-name">{{ cardProduct.vendor }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if show_inventory -%}
            <span class="stock-status" style="--stock-color: {{ stock_color }};">
              <span class="stock-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ stock_content }}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <a
        {% if cardProduct == blank %}role="link" aria-disabled="true"{% else %}href="{{ product_url }}"{% endif %}
        class="product-title"
      >
        {%- if cardProduct != blank -%}
          {{- cardProduct.title | strip_html -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- 'onboarding.product_title' | t -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>

      {%- unless hideContent -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Fixed-height slot. gs-reviews renders nothing when a product has
          no reviews, which made rated and unrated cards different heights
          and pushed their buttons out of line.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="product-card-rating">
          {%- render 'gs-reviews', cardProduct: cardProduct -%}
        </div>

        {%- if cardProduct != blank -%}
          {%- render 'gs-price', cardProduct: cardProduct, cardVariant: card_variant -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="product-price">
            <span class="price-item actual-price">&mdash;</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if complementary != true and show_swatch_row and showSwatches -%}
          <div class="product-card-swatches">
            {%- render 'gs-product-colors-option', cardProduct: cardProduct -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if compareTrue and show_compare and cardProduct != blank -%}
          <div class="compare-add-button" data-compare-item>
            <div class="compare-checkbox">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                name="productCompare{{ cardProduct.id }}"
                id="ProductCompare-{{ cardProduct.id }}"
                class="js-compare-checkbox"
                data-product-url="{{ cardProduct.url }}"
                data-product-id="{{ cardProduct.id }}"
                data-compare-checkbox
              >
              <label class="compare-checkmark compare-label" for="ProductCompare-{{ cardProduct.id }}">
                {{ 'onboarding.compare' | t }}
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

      {%- endunless -%}
      </div>

      {%- unless hideContent -%}
        {%- if show_quickview and quickview_style == 'button' and cardProduct != blank and quickViewtrue -%}
          <div class="product-quickview-button">
            {%- if enableQuickAdd -%}
              <div
                class="product-quickview"
                data-quick-view-availability="{{ cardProduct.available }}"
                {% if cardProduct.variants.size == 1 %}
                  data-variant-id="{{ cardProduct.variants[0].id }}"
                {% endif %}
              >
                <span>
                  {%- if cardProduct.available -%}
                    {{- 'products.product.quick_add' | t -}}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{- 'products.product.sold_out' | t -}}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
              </div>
            {%- else -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                A real link, so this works with JavaScript off and is
                crawlable. gs-quick-view.js intercepts the click.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <a
                href="{{ product_url }}"
                data-quick-view-availability="{{ cardProduct.available }}"
                class="product-quickview"
                aria-label="{{ 'onboarding.quickview' | t }}: {{ cardProduct.title | escape }}"
                data-quick-view="{{ cardProduct.handle }}"
              >
                <span>
                  {%- if cardProduct.available -%}
                    {{- 'onboarding.quickview' | t -}}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{- 'products.product.sold_out' | t -}}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
